course: dictionary
lesson: 2691
title: Experts and their words
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A dietitian is a trained health worker who gives expert advice about food and healthy eating. Look at the clues in «Dietitians suggest eating oily fish, such as salmon or sardines, about once a week.» The words suggest, eating and fish tell you that a dietitian advises people about what to eat.
explain: Context also shows you who the word describes. In «Doctors and dietitians agree vegetables matter for health», the two are named together, so a dietitian is a health expert, just like a doctor. Ask yourself: is this person trained to know the facts, or are they only giving an opinion?
explain: Some people online sound like experts but have no training. Mum says, «Your YouTuber builds great castles, but he's not a dietitian, love.» She means that being popular online does not make someone qualified to give food advice.
fact: A dietitian is a trained health worker who gives expert advice about food and healthy eating.
fact: Dietitians often work in hospitals and help people with illnesses or special needs.
fact: «Dietitian» can also be spelled «dietician»; both spellings mean the same thing.
fact: «Dietitians suggest eating oily fish, such as salmon or sardines, about once a week.»
fact: «Registered dietitian» is a phrase for a dietitian who is officially qualified.
exercise: What is a dietitian? | *A trained expert who gives advice about food and healthy eating | A person who sells sweets at a fair | A person who plays games live online | A type of fish found in rivers
exercise: «Dietitians suggest eating oily fish, such as salmon or sardines, about once a week.» What does suggest mean here? | *Advise or recommend | Sell | Forbid | Cook
exercise: Mum says «he's not a dietitian». What does this tell you? | *He is not a trained food expert | He is a famous doctor | He works in a hospital as a dietitian | He is a fish seller
test: Which word means a trained expert who gives advice about healthy eating? | Streamer | Influencer | *Dietitian | Scam
test: «Doctors and dietitians agree vegetables matter for health.» What kind of person is a dietitian here? | A castle builder | *A health expert | A pet owner | A game player
exam: Why should you check that a food adviser online is a dietitian before trusting them? | *Because a dietitian is trained, and not every online voice is qualified | Because dietitians never give advice about fish | Because dietitians are always famous online | Because dietitians only work at the seaside
